.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-account-auto-topup-get - Automatic balance top-up setting


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro account auto-topup get [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Automatic balance top-up setting

.PP
When the balance drops below \fBthreshold\fR, \fBamount\fR (TRY, excl. VAT) is charged to the saved card and credited as a balance top-up invoice incl. VAT. Checked hourly. Limits per day/month apply.

.PP
API: GET /cloud/account/auto-topup (operationId getAutoTopup, scope billing_read)


